data: {"id": "e2278b7951cf4740-thinking-parallel_evidence-871", "run_id": "e2278b7951cf4740", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "好的，我理解了任务。我需要针对 `aiops-case-01/workload-68c557d875-gtzc8` 这个 Pod 进行根因调查，它当前处于 Pending 状态，初步判断为 PendingUnschedulable。\n\n根据已有信息和 plan，我需要执行以下步骤：\n1. `kubectl_describe` 查看 Pod 详情和事件\n2. `kubectl_get_yaml` 查看 Pod 的资源请求和调度约束\n3. `kubectl_get_by_kind_in_cluster` 查看集群节点状态\n4. Metrics、Logging、Tracing、Topology 的首轮查询已执行（见 pre-react-observability-baseline）\n\n让我先执行 Kubernetes 相关的工具调用。\n\n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 1, "ts_ms": 1789038917590, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

